# /shard.lock
# The user's own default inventory at the repo root only - NOT anchoring
# this with a leading / would also match spec/fixtures/*.ini, silently
# excluding the integration-test fixtures from every commit (this
# happened: spec/fixtures/inventory.ini was never actually committed,
# only ever present locally on disk - a fresh clone or CI would have been
# missing it entirely).
/inventory.ini
/spec/tmp/

